       "text": "I entered the order as ORD-0001: metformin 1700 mg by mouth three times daily with meals.\n\nThe order note says the dose is above the usual maximum (5,100 mg/day). It also records that you confirmed the dose is intentional, on the specialist's recommendation after standard dosing failed, and that this is documented in the chart.\n\nAt this dose, I'd suggest also asking pharmacy to review the order. It's also worth monitoring renal function, watching for GI intolerance, and being alert for signs of lactic acidosis."
